    "biography": "<table class=\"sbn-ficha\"><tbody><tr><th>Concept</th><td>The oldest of Montgomery&#39;s bounty hunters</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The oldest, sixty. He&#39;s been with Montgomery for twenty years and is starting to wonder what exactly his boss is. Uses the same stats as @UUID[Actor.L1oU4dlqHg8Yszon]{Montgomery&#39;s Bounty Hunters} with <strong>Insight 5</strong>. If the coterie wins him over (<a class=\"sbn-tirada\" data-sbn-tirada=\"attributes.charisma skills.persuasion\" data-dificultad=\"3\" data-label=\"Charisma + Persuasion (Difficulty 3)\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-dice-d10\"></i> Charisma + Persuasion (Difficulty 3)</a>), he warns them when Montgomery gives the order to hunt them down (@UUID[JournalEntry.C7cxKf7kcAELzuJ1.JournalEntryPage.aGN9NHO00wmdUzVn]{A3-E04 · The Pack Wavers}).</p>",
